[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17227.47, "timestamp": "04:47:07", "text": "好的。你刚刚把我拉黑了。哦，对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17230.39, "timestamp": "04:47:10", "text": "对不起。我有个主意。删除这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17235.59, "timestamp": "04:47:15", "text": "删除这个。不要动它。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17239.27, "timestamp": "04:47:19", "text": "我们快到了吗？是的。是的。呃，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17246.628, "timestamp": "04:47:26", "text": "建一些楼梯。该死"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17249.59, "timestamp": "04:47:29", "text": "令人尴尬。你那边一切都好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17252.47, "timestamp": "04:47:32", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17254.948, "timestamp": "04:47:34", "text": "我们快到了。创建一个平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17257.67, "timestamp": "04:47:37", "text": "在那之后。就像用错误的方式建造一样。一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17263.67, "timestamp": "04:47:43", "text": "向上。对，就是这样。创建一个平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17267.75, "timestamp": "04:47:47", "text": "现在就走。哦，不。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17275.99, "timestamp": "04:47:55", "text": "是的。我的天哪，这是90年代的风格吗？"}]